  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In this project &apos;Basic activities for international responsible business conduct (RBC) agreement for Food Products&#x2019;, Stichting Woord en Daad, Federatie Nederlandse Vakbeweging, Stichting Cordaid, Stichting CNV Internationaal and Stichting Global March Against child Labour contribute their knowledge and experience to support Dutch companies with implementing human resources (HR) due diligence during the implementation phase of RBC sector agreement for Food Products.</narrative>
